  (descr "Arduino Uno R3 SHIELD header set — the four female headers a shield presents to the base board. Pads are the Uno R3 shield standard (including the 1.52 mm D7/D8 offset), taken pad-for-pad from KiCad Module:Arduino_UNO_R3. The body is the four header strips ONLY: a shield's middle is free board, which is where its components go. (authored by Synqit)")
